{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140230/extras/8a193c97f9c24294309322a873906c4e.webp?t=1762300423\" width=473 height=36 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140230/extras/0dd52c798131ca9708c2fee17889cd84.poster.avif?t=1762300423\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140230/extras/0dd52c798131ca9708c2fee17889cd84.webm?t=1762300423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140230/extras/0dd52c798131ca9708c2fee17889cd84.mp4?t=1762300423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true Wizard knows how to combine their spells correctly to maximize their potential. Casting spells in the correct order will bring an Invocation, a powerful magic that allows you to learn new spells. Because of this, your pool of spells will be constantly changing, giving you the chance to adapt to every enemy. Deciding which spell to cast and when is what makes the true difference between a Wizard and a Wimp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140230/extras/87b029315f513c85e3e7909902a99db0.webp?t=1762300423\" width=475 height=36 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140230/extras/8facf01288dfccce408939e57405bc2c.poster.avif?t=1762300423\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140230/extras/8facf01288dfccce408939e57405bc2c.webm?t=1762300423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140230/extras/8facf01288dfccce408939e57405bc2c.mp4?t=1762300423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each step during the Trial by Magic is crucial. Which location will you travel to first? Which trinket will you carry during your travels? What new spells will you learn? These and many other questions that can be solved by picking between 3 choices are some of the challenges you will face during the trial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140230/extras/ad7d37a38b1c002c2cb76fa771713185.webp?t=1762300423\" width=597 height=36 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140230/extras/013e42041c7c0b829a752003f1af1a33.poster.avif?t=1762300423\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140230/extras/013e42041c7c0b829a752003f1af1a33.webm?t=1762300423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140230/extras/013e42041c7c0b829a752003f1af1a33.mp4?t=1762300423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019re up for the trial? Get graded at the end of each run to know how you did.  Reach the highest Wizard score and prove you\u2019re no Wimp nor just an ordinary Wizard.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4140230?t=1762300423","background_raw":"https://store.akama